        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1960's world governments classified many events at the highest levels, including certain events behind the space race and Project MK Ultra. Researchers have reconfigured the events of one of the most well guarded and &quot;cosmic classified&quot; secrets of these programs. You can now experience for yourself what happened to one of the subjects in this Psychological Thriller / Walking Simulator. Take a trip to the moon alongside an unwelcome tour guide. Listen to his words and decide if you should follow him, or find a different path.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on the moon's surface in the bounds of an unexplainable anomaly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/c42e889ffa19ed395d1de934eebf908d.avif?t=1761222200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras_big/c42e889ffa19ed395d1de934eebf908d.avif?t=1761222200 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how details from your past created the person you are now.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/e1ca4852333ae0253f04b7736ce89ab4.avif?t=1761222200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras_big/e1ca4852333ae0253f04b7736ce89ab4.avif?t=1761222200 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through an unknown labyrinth in a dark and foreign terrain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/80303f38c12d918addcc10d0e1162a57.avif?t=1761222200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras_big/80303f38c12d918addcc10d0e1162a57.avif?t=1761222200 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1960's world governments classified many events at the highest levels, including certain events behind the space race and Project MK Ultra. Researchers have reconfigured the events of one of the most well guarded and &quot;cosmic classified&quot; secrets of these programs. You can now experience for yourself what happened to one of the subjects in this Psychological Thriller / Walking Simulator. Take a trip to the moon alongside an unwelcome tour guide. Listen to his words and decide if you should follow him, or find a different path.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on the moon's surface in the bounds of an unexplainable anomaly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/c42e889ffa19ed395d1de934eebf908d.avif?t=1761222200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras_big/c42e889ffa19ed395d1de934eebf908d.avif?t=1761222200 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how details from your past created the person you are now.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/e1ca4852333ae0253f04b7736ce89ab4.avif?t=1761222200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras_big/e1ca4852333ae0253f04b7736ce89ab4.avif?t=1761222200 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through an unknown labyrinth in a dark and foreign terrain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/80303f38c12d918addcc10d0e1162a57.avif?t=1761222200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras_big/80303f38c12d918addcc10d0e1162a57.avif?t=1761222200 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Discover the far side of the moon and the effects of participating in MK Ultra in this psychological thriller. It will be dark and nothing will tell you what to do next. Find what mystery awaits above and below the moon's surface as you are joined by an unexpected tour guide.",
